      "text": "Hari(H), Gita(G), Irfan(I) and Saira(S) are siblings (i.e., brothers and sisters). All were born on 1 $^{st}$ January. The age difference between any two successive siblings (that is born one after another) is less than three years. Given the following facts: i. Hari's age + Gita's age > Irfan's age + Saira's age ii. The age difference between Gita and Saira is one year. However Gita is not the oldest and Saira is not the youngest. iii. There are no twins. In what order they were born (oldest first)?",
