      "text": "Rishi and Swathi are students of Class 5. Pavan and Tanvi are students of Class 4. Rishi and Pavan are boys. Swathi and Tanvi are girls. The four students played a total of three games of chess. The games were played one after another. A player who lost a game did not participate in any more games. It was observed that: I. the first game was the only game where two students of the same class played against each other, II. the students of Class 5 won more games than the students of Class 4, and III. the boys won two games and the girls won one game. The student who did not lose any game is \\_\\_\\_\\_.",
