      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "year": 2011,
      "text": "In a class of 300 students in an M.Tech programme, each student is required to take at least one subject from the following three: • M600: Advanced Engineering Mathematics • C600: Computational Methods for Engineers • E600: Experimental Techniques for Engineers The registration data for the M.Tech class shows that 100 students have taken M600, 200 students have taken C600, and 60 students have taken E600. What is the maximum possible number of students in the class who have taken all the above three subjects?",
      "options": [
        "20",
        "30",
        "40",
        "50"
      ],
      "answer": [
        1
      ],
