      "marks": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "year": 2019,
      "text": "The police arrested four criminals -P, Q, R and S. The criminals knew each other. They made the following statements: - $P$ says \"Q committed the crime.\" - $Q$ says \"S committed the crime.\" - $R$ says “I did not do it.” - $S$ says \"What Q said about me is false\". Assume only one of the arrested four committed the crime and only one of the statements made above is true. Who committed the crime?",
      "options": [
        "P",
        "R",
        "S",
        "Q"
      ],
      "answer": [
        1
      ],
